  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to West African Regional Integration Programme (SWARIP)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall aim is to reduce the costs of doing business in West Africa through better regional integration. Project goals are to maintain a West African average growth rate of 2.5% per annum, for 8 West African countries to improve their World Bank Doing Business rankings, and for 8 West African countries reduce their average costs of trading across borders.</narrative>
  </description>
